---
export const prerender = false;

import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
import GroupSizePulls from '../components/GroupSizePulls.astro';
import { env } from 'cloudflare:workers';
import { FEATURE_FLAGS } from '../lib/feature-flags';
import { getPullScoreRows } from '../lib/pull-scores';
import { ULATEK_ENCOUNTER_ID } from '../lib/group-size-pulls';

if (!Astro.locals.isGuildMember) return Astro.redirect('/auth/login');
if (!FEATURE_FLAGS.tools || !FEATURE_FLAGS.groupSizeAnalysis) return Astro.redirect('/');

const seen = new Set<string>();
const pulls = (await getPullScoreRows(env.DB))
  .filter((row) => row.encounterId === ULATEK_ENCOUNTER_ID && row.difficulty === 4)
  .filter((row) => {
    const key = `${row.reportCode}:${row.fightId}`;
    if (seen.has(key)) return false;
    seen.add(key);
    return true;
  })
  .map(({ reportCode, fightId, fightEndUtc, isKill }) => ({ reportCode, fightId, fightEndUtc, isKill }))
  .sort((a, b) => b.fightEndUtc - a.fightEndUtc);
---

<Layout title="Group Size Analysis | The Hidden Lodge" description="Review Heroic Ula'tek pull damage, 10-minute pace, and each DPS player's boss damage requirement.">
  <div class="analysis-page">
    <PageHeader title="Group Size Analysis" description="Heroic Ula'tek: review real pulls, boss damage pace, and each DPS player's target." />

    <div class="intro card">
      <p>Select an ingested Heroic Ula’tek pull to compare its boss damage against the 10:00 enrage. Member damage counts only Ula’tek, Venomous Heart, and the shared-health Gore Rattle tail.</p>
      <p>The fight runs on a fixed clock: three 20-second Heart burns (2:15, 4:44, 9:33) deal about half of all boss damage, while the Stage 2 add phase and the intermission deal almost none. Pace is measured against that timeline, so a short wipe isn’t flattered by skipping the downtime or penalized for missing later burns. The expandable math panel shows how each number was calculated.</p>
    </div>

    <GroupSizePulls pulls={pulls} />

    <details class="card sources">
      <summary>Sources and limits</summary>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="https://www.warcraftlogs.com/v2-api-docs/warcraft/report.doc.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Warcraft Logs report API</a> supplies fight duration, boss remaining percentage, player roles, and damage filtered to the three shared-health targets. Each pull is cached locally after it is opened.</li>
        <li>WCL does not provide maximum boss HP directly. Starting HP is estimated from boss-only damage and the remaining-health percentage. Pulls with 5% or less progress do not receive an HP estimate or DPS target.</li>
        <li>10:00 is the encounter enrage: guild logs show the boss gaining Fury Unleashed at 9:58.7 and Berserk at 10:15.9.</li>
        <li>Heart burn windows come from the boss’s Venomous Heart aura, which starts at the same second on every pull; each pull is aligned to its own first burn. Stage weights are the guild’s median boss damage per stage relative to Stage 1, measured from 21 pulls of 7:39 or longer (Sep 19–25, 2026). Burn 3 and Stage 3 weights rest on the 3 pulls that reached Burn 3, so treat them as rough.</li>
        <li>Projections assume the raid keeps its pace through the stages a pull didn’t reach. They don’t model deaths, cooldown timing, or a burn going unusually well or badly.</li>
      </ul>
    </details>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .analysis-page { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: var(--space-7) var(--space-5) var(--space-9); display: grid; gap: var(--space-6); }
  .analysis-page :global(.page-header) { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .intro p, .sources li { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.55; }
  .intro p:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
  .intro p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .sources summary { cursor: pointer; font-weight: 700; }
  .sources ul { padding-left: var(--space-5); margin-bottom: 0; }
  .sources a { color: var(--gold-bright); }
</style>
